data: {"type":"message_update","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"text","text":"## What a derivative measures\n\nStart from the definition, read as a statement about nudges:\n\n$$\nf'(a) = \\lim_{\\Delta x \\to 0} \\frac{f(a+\\Delta x) - f(a)}{\\Delta x}\n$$\n\nIn words: move the input slightly away from $a$, look at how far the output moves, and divide. As the nudge gets smaller, that ratio settles on one number, and that number is $f'(a)$. Rearranged, the definition says:\n\n> [!IMPORTANT]\n> For a small nudge $\\Delta x$ at the point $a$: $\\quad \\Delta f \\approx f'(a)\\,"}],"api":"claude-code-cli","provider":"claude-code","model":"claude-opus-5-5","usage":{"input":2,"output":6,"cacheRead":17510,"cacheWrite":16029,"totalTokens":33547,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0},"cacheWrite1h":16029},"stopReason":"pending","timestamp":1792860994219,"responseId":"msg_011CgMR1Z5HBq5VkbdJ6CTE6"}}

data: {"type":"message_update","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"text","text":"## What a derivative measures\n\nStart from the definition, read as a statement about nudges:\n\n$$\nf'(a) = \\lim_{\\Delta x \\to 0} \\frac{f(a+\\Delta x) - f(a)}{\\Delta x}\n$$\n\nIn words: move the input slightly away from $a$, look at how far the output moves, and divide. As the nudge gets smaller, that ratio settles on one number, and that number is $f'(a)$. Rearranged, the definition says:\n\n> [!IMPORTANT]\n> For a small nudge $\\Delta x$ at the point $a$: $\\quad \\Delta f \\approx f'(a)\\,\\Delta x$.\n>"}],"api":"claude-code-cli","provider":"claude-code","model":"claude-opus-5-5","usage":{"input":2,"output":6,"cacheRead":17510,"cacheWrite":16029,"totalTokens":33547,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0},"cacheWrite1h":16029},"stopReason":"pending","timestamp":1792860994219,"responseId":"msg_011CgMR1Z5HBq5VkbdJ6CTE6"}}

